  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><strong>Đúng</strong>. Tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có ba cạnh bằng nhau nên là tam giác đều, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTứ giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo a